<title>FINLAND: FINNISH 8-MTH BEVERAGES SALES FALL 0.9 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>FINNISH 8-MTH BEVERAGES SALES FALL 0.9 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales in Finland of beer, soft drinks and moneral waters fell 0.9 percent year-on-year in January-August to 480.2 million litres, the Federation of the Brewing and Soft Drinks Industry said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
